---
---

<section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-blue-950 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-indigo-950 dark:to-slate-950 text-white relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b border-slate-800/60 transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#fff_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px]"></div>
  
  <!-- Glows decorativos de fondo -->
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
      
      <div class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl text-center lg:text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-400/30 text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm">
          <i class="fa-light fa-building-columns text-blue-400"></i>
          <span>Portal Exclusivo para Instituciones Clientes</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight font-heading leading-tight">
          ¿Tu institución ya utiliza SIAPP? Gestiona tu cuenta y recursos
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Ingresa con tu RUC o correo institucional para consultar tus comprobantes electrónicos (PDF/XML), reportar tus vouchers de pago y transferencias, y descargar manuales oficiales para licenciamiento MINEDU.
        </p>

        <!-- Píldoras de servicios y utilidades del portal -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3 pt-1 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">
            <i class="fa-light fa-file-invoice-dollar text-emerald-400"></i>
            <span>Facturas y Recibos PDF / XML</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">
            <i class="fa-light fa-receipt text-amber-400"></i>
            <span>Reporte de Vouchers de Pago</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">
            <i class="fa-light fa-book-bookmark text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>Manuales de Licenciamiento</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/clientes"
          class="px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-400 hover:to-indigo-500 active:scale-[0.98] text-white shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/25 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center"
        >
          <i class="fa-light fa-arrow-right-to-bracket text-base"></i>
          <span>Acceder al Portal de Cliente</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contacto"
          class="px-6 py-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center"
        >
          <i class="fa-light fa-headset"></i>
          <span>Mesa de Ayuda</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
